# armour/woman/mail_sleeve_r: Mail's sleeve over the arm: the upper arm in the mail brick to the elbow
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; armour and helms to P2c's ARMOUR / HELMS). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# WOMAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): every side arm key the clips name (runB runF pB pM pF pK pN, guard; the far arm's
# pump keys): the arm's upper arm and forearm in the mail brick (W1: no more bare tunic sleeves in the run or drawn frames).
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i2) mail as lit planes with a sparse ring dot (mailfix.py)
use person
body woman
role armour mail
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

view D key down origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view D key down1 origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view D key idle origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view D key up origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view D key up1 origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view D key lap origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view U key down origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xxv

view U key idle origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xxv

view U key up origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xxv

view U key lap origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xxv

view R key B origin 2 -4
|.vyxv
|vyxv.

view R key F origin -1 -4
|vyxv.
|.vyxv

view R key N origin 0 -4
|vxyv
|vyxv

view R key idle origin 0 -4
|vxyv
|vyxv

view R key runB origin 2 -4
|.vyxv
|vyxv.

view R key runF origin 0 -4
|vyxy.xv

view R key pB origin 6 -1
|......vyxv
|....vyxv..
|..vyxv....
|.vxxv.....
|.vyxv.....
|vyxv......

view R key pM origin 0 -4
|vyxv.
|.vyxv
|..vv.

view R key pF origin 0 -1
|vyxv..
|.vyxv.
|..vyxv
|..vyxv

view R key pK origin 2 -4
|.vyxv
|vyxv.

view R key pN origin 0 -4
|vyxv.
|.vyxv

view R key guard origin -2 1
|.vyxyv
|vyyxwv
|vyyxwv
|.vxxv.
|..vv..

view L key pB origin 2 -4
|vxwv....
|..vywv..
|....vyxv

view L key pM origin 3 -4
|.vxwv
|vyxv.

view L key pF origin 5 -4
|...vxv..
|vyy.wxwv

view L key pK origin 1 -4
|vxwv.
|.vyxv

view L key pN origin 0 0
|.

view L key guard origin 9 1 layer armNear
|...vyxyv
|..vyxxwv
|vyyxwv..
|.vxxv...
|..vv....

# ---- (P2c SLICE-ARMOUR, ADD) the fall's `fling`; `guard` facing down and up as the idle; `runF` facing down and up shows only the fist (empty)
view D key fling origin 5 -1
|....vxx
|...vxxw
|..vyxw.

view U key fling origin 1 -1
|xwv....
|xyxv...
|.yyxv..

view R key fling origin 9 -1
|........vywxv
|......vywwv..
|....vyxwv....

view D key guard origin 1 -4
|vyx
|vxw

view U key guard origin 1 -4
|xxv
|xxv

view D key runF origin 0 0
|.

view U key runF origin 0 0
|.
